  "route_rules":["All routes are loopback-only under LLD-01 runtime and use LLD-12 authenticated browser policy; authoritative mutations use anti-forgery and COMMAND_ENVELOPE_V1.","GET and explicit preview routes are side-effect-free and never reserve stock, create physical units, accept warehouse decisions or alter Task state.","Physical Spare Part Unit creation from an RMA occurs only on accepted actual inbound receipt; RMA authorization alone never creates a physical unit.","Inventory consumes reviewed Task evidence through LLD-05 and records separate physical consequences; it never writes Task execution, outcome, cancellation, retry or Objective lifecycle.","Communication-derived evidence remains proposal-only until the exact Inventory proposal is deliberately accepted under current-state revalidation.","Artifact generation routes belong LLD-09/10 integration and never imply an Inventory lifecycle transition."]
